    "detailed_description": "Eve Of The Storm diverges from traditional survival-building games by incorporating card-based gameplay, challenging players to think about how to maximize benefits from the cards. <br><br>Expand the island by placing terrain block <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587690/extras/961e89623b5716b5ccac015e2138046d.avif?t=1693970412\" width=294 height=151 /></span><br><br>Place different buildings to produce and decorate the island<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587690/extras/536b9c3295f76a44352b4df1916ec794.avif?t=1693970412\" width=294 height=167 /></span><br><br>Food is the essential resource to survive in this game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587690/extras/36b0e357e6a54679aa619d0abf2cc175.webp?t=1693970412\" width=103 height=46 /></span><br><br>Draw cards will cost food and it will increase as time goes on.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587690/extras/4078f5a6ee271ad6e7cbf416473e85e6.avif?t=1693970412\" width=79 height=86 /></span><br><br>Gear is another important resource, earning enough gear will achieve the final goal of the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587690/extras/722e20f5ed0c21fabcc58cddb1a5b7b4.avif?t=1693970412\" width=118 height=123 /></span><br><br>There are more than 30 cards in the game for players to experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2587690/extras/840fd274a65fe8219f74f7c7c3c6372e.avif?t=1693970412\" width=294 height=322 /></span>",
